        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 32,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "When Hezekiah saw that Sennacherib had come, and that he was planning to fight against Jerusalem,",
      "ko": "히스기야가 산헤립이 예루살렘을 치러 온 것을 보고",
      "source_text_hash": "14b63f005059197fd827f849d32abd51104e538b19bae637ac2e6785d6b4b543",
      "translation_text_hash": "ab838a1173f45634353c1465a225c8e3cc4657c004f530aace1424b3b788dc5d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "히스기야가 산헤립이 예루살렘을 치러 온 것을 보고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "ab838a1173f45634353c1465a225c8e3cc4657c004f530aace1424b3b788dc5d"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:2CH:32:3",
      "sequence": 11879,
