        "verse": 3
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 32,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "he took counsel with his princes and his mighty men to stop the waters of the springs which were outside of the city, and they helped him.",
      "ko": "그 방백들과 용사들로 더불어 의논하고 성 밖에 모든 물 근원을 막고자하매 저희가 돕더라",
      "source_text_hash": "68513c7033175e7b2d10680af9be38014106475a2a05176927ca47b774049bd1",
      "translation_text_hash": "e96b5b2e3dd439fc7f04fd063dafc54ba069ababe91aa4b82f37496d4c4f30f4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 방백들과 용사들로 더불어 의논하고 성 밖에 모든 물 근원을 막고자하매 저희가 돕더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "e96b5b2e3dd439fc7f04fd063dafc54ba069ababe91aa4b82f37496d4c4f30f4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:2CH:32:4",
      "sequence": 11880,
