      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 32,
          "verse": 25
        }
      ],
      "en": "But Hezekiah didn’t reciprocate appropriate to the benefit done for him, because his heart was lifted up. Therefore there was wrath on him, Judah, and Jerusalem.",
      "ko": "히스기야가 마음이 교만하여 그 받은 은혜를 보답지 아니하므로 진노가 저와 유다와 예루살렘에 임하게 되었더니",
      "source_text_hash": "88ad86b2eeb81acf81be2e8eb37edf9fccce6d25fcbba6d28a01ff5f8cf3904c",
      "translation_text_hash": "c7af9c620bee917cbd97e70aebea59db6adae077acfbada0f79b601ab05c9574",
