      "en": "Moreover he provided for himself cities, and possessions of flocks and herds in abundance; for God had given him abundant possessions.",
      "ko": "양떼와 많은 소떼를 위하여 성읍들을 세웠으니 이는 하나님이 저에게 재산을 심히 많이 주셨음이며",
      "source_text_hash": "7c4667fc501b4ae5395a2154e986918224dd26f6a8ff8b5de7e01080037bd0c0",
      "translation_text_hash": "3f5f80bbae2a3071c4f7675a582b565fb37634f7257b185ef35b9c5d488ea615",
