          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 32,
          "verse": 33
        }
      ],
      "en": "Hezekiah slept with his fathers, and they buried him in the ascent to the tombs of the sons of David. All Judah and the inhabitants of Jerusalem honored him at his death. Manasseh his son reigned in his place.",
      "ko": "히스기야가 그 열조와 함께 자매 온 유다와 예루살렘 거민이 저를 다윗 자손의 묘실 중 높은 곳에 장사하여 저의 죽음에 존경함을 표하였더라 그 아들 므낫세가 대신하여 왕이 되니라",
      "source_text_hash": "d2bb994f5ef058482eea614294e783d3acdf1e87643fe556c4e6626b88a3b7a5",
      "translation_text_hash": "cbd4740117ecd1cf745522c8c45a90b57270cbd5bd3349f9762db8720903471f",
